.* QTOCPORT: CFGTCP option 4, the port restrictions. WRKPORT has
.* 1=Add and 4=Remove; WRKPORTD shows the list only.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PORTCL BASETYPE='BIN 31'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=UPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=PCLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PLOWER CLASS=PORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PUPPER CLASS=UPCL.
:VAR NAME=PPROTO CLASS=PCLCL.
:VAR NAME=PUSER CLASS=NAMECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PORTS VARS='OPT PLOWER PUPPER PPROTO PUSER'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Print list
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION='RETURN 17'.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION='RETURN 18'.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPORT HELP=HLPPORT KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Port Restrictions
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PORTS SCROLL=YES.(No port restrictions)
:LISTACT OPTION=1 ENTER='CMD ?ADDTCPPORT'.1=Add
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 104'.4=Remove
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTGRP COL=RANGE.--Port Range---
:LISTCOL VAR=PLOWER USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=8.Lower
:LISTCOL VAR=PUPPER USAGE=OUTPUT.Upper    *ONLY
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=PPROTO USAGE=OUTPUT.Protocol
:LISTCOL VAR=PUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.User       Profile
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPORTD HELP=HLPPORT KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with TCP/IP Port Restrictions
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PORTS SCROLL=YES.(No port restrictions)
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTGRP COL=RANGE.--Port Range---
:LISTCOL VAR=PLOWER USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=8.Lower
:LISTCOL VAR=PUPPER USAGE=OUTPUT.Upper    *ONLY
:ELISTGRP.
:LISTCOL VAR=PPROTO USAGE=OUTPUT.Protocol
:LISTCOL VAR=PUSER USAGE=OUTPUT.User       Profile
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPPORT.Work with TCP/IP Port Restrictions - Help
:P.Ports kept for chosen user profiles: a port or range of a protocol
with an entry can be used only by the profiles its entries name. Type 4
next to an entry to remove it; option 1 adds one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
